<title>USA: Fleming Cos settles two lawsuits.</title>
<headline>Fleming Cos settles two lawsuits.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleming Cos Inc said on Wednesday it reached an agreement in principle to settle two lawsuits pending against the company in the U.S. District Court in Miami.</p>
<p>The company said the claimants will dismiss the actions against Fleming in exchange for a $19.5 million payment plus $500,000 for costs and expenses. All related claims involving Fleming also will be dismissed.</p>
<p>The company said the charges involved a former subsidiary, Malone &amp; Hyde.</p>
